<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston starts retailers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston starts retailers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it started coverage of nine retail companies.</p>
<p>-- Started Federated Department Stores and Zale Corp with strong buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Started May Department Stores Co and Wal-Mart Stores Inc with buy ratings.  </p>
<p>-- started Sears, Roebuck and Co, Kmart Corp, Dillard Department Stores Inc, Waban Inc and Costco Cos Inc with hold ratings.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
